do MusicPlayer.pause_music()
audio "res://Audio/Music/TutorialCutscene.wav" [bus="Music"]
join CropDuster right [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
CropDuster: Well, congrats, newbie. You must be doing something right if the Guild decided to give you access to the Gemstone Upgrade Station.
CropDuster: This station will give you an edge in combat by allowing you to mount Gemstones to your weapon.
CropDuster: Gemstone Chests will now appear throughout the tower. Break them open, and you may discover Gemstones that enhance your weapon's abilities and grant you bonus stats!
CropDuster: There are four types of Gems, each with a unique purpose\:\
Red Diamonds enhance your combat prowess.\
Blue Triangles improve your defensive capabilities.\
Green Spheres increase your mobility.\
Yellow Squares boost combat efficiency and status effects.
CropDuster: Some Gems are rarer than others. If you're having trouble finding the ones you need, you can use the Computer Terminal to improve your chances.
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_player()
do MusicPlayer.unpause_music()